{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#card-zh","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-notifier 在对话轮次正常完成时发送通知，显示会话标题、完成耗时和本轮回答摘要。页面客户端在线时使用页面通知，离线时调用系统原生通知。用户可设置跳过子代理会话、筛除较短轮次、调整摘要长度和提示音；没有会话标题时使用配置的默认标题。通知仅针对正常完成的轮次；用户中断、执行出错等不会触发提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:597-644"]}
{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#card-en","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-turn-notifier alerts you when a turn completes, showing the session title, elapsed time, and reply summary. It uses an in-page notification when the client is online and a native alert otherwise. Settings can skip subagents or short turns, adjust summary length and sound, and set title fallback.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:597-644"]}
{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#intent-1","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让 DSH 在回答完成后提醒我。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:602-644"]}
