{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#feature-1","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-notifier 的功能「完成轮次通知」：插件监听会话轮次结束事件，仅在正常完成时投递通知。通知包含会话标题、完成耗时和回答摘要；可设置跳过子代理或忽略耗时较短的轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:597-619"]}
{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#feature-2","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-notifier 的功能「页面内通知」：当页面客户端近期有轮询且 preferClient 开启时，插件保存最近完成事件，由注入页面脚本调用 Notification API 显示通知，避免同时发送原生通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:432-489","lib/index.js:621-637"]}
{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#feature-3","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-notifier 的功能「原生通知」：页面离线时，macOS 用 terminal-notifier 或 osascript，Linux 用 notify-send，Windows 用 PowerShell toast。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:326-351","lib/index.js:354-429"]}
{"unit_id":"king-shao__dsh-turn-notifier#caveat-1","repo":"king-shao/dsh-turn-notifier","commit":"8a8a5c6079be74ea43ef548151a90f2480c5ce11","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-notifier 的原生通知依赖系统工具：Linux 需 notify-send，Windows 需 PowerShell；页面通知还要求 webServer 可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:326-351","lib/index.js:364-403","lib/index.js:538-559"]}
